The use of `pci_enable_device(pdev)` enables the PCI device but does not ensure that `pci_disable_device(pdev)` and `pci_release_regions(pdev)` are called during the removal process. This can lead to resource leaks and improper device management, as the resources allocated for the device may not be released correctly when the device is removed.

